Viewer 0.1

Here is a *very* simple but fast picture viewer for the
Series3. Put the following files in the directories shown;

 Viewer.opa    \APP\
 Viewer.opl    \OPL\
 *.pic         \OPD\

Install the application Viewer.opa in the System menu and
you should get and icon like a slide appear with a list of
picture files underneath. Press enter to select a pic file
to view, press enter again when done.

